<title>JAPAN: Nippon Pigment - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Pigment - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.85		vs	   18.28</p>
<p> Operating	   61    million	  vs	   93    million</p>
<p> Current	     71    million	  vs	   73    million</p>
<p> Net		   67    million	  vs	   38    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.25 yen	  vs	    2.42 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   --		 vs	     --</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Pigment Co Ltd is a top specialist maker of resin colouring compounds and colouring agents.</p>
